   820                              <1> ; chkst1, chkst2: stop with O unless the 1 or 2 bytes at TOS are in the
   821                              <1> ; program's space: from the letter page up to the heap limit. Memory above
   822                              <1> ; the heap top but below the limit is the program's own: Tiny BASIC keeps
   823                              <1> ; its lines there.
